### The docs site's lockfile is committed: the docs workflow builds with `uv run --locked`, which fails without
### it. This negation is what keeps it in git, because a global *.lock ignore would otherwise hide it.
!website/uv.lock

### Zensical build output ###
website/**/site/
website/**/.cache/

